        ARM == "CDA" & !TRR_ID_CODE %in% ritux_mono_lm_ids ~ "CDA (non-Rituxan)",
        TRUE ~ as.character(ARM)
      ))
  } else {
    # Overlapping view: Rituxan patients appear TWICE, once in CDA and
    # once in their own row. Denominators downstream come from this same frame
    # so they stay internally consistent, but arm Ns will not sum to the
